<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>{{headline}} — Rabbit Tracker</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { background: #f4f7f9; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #0e2a33; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00627f 0%, #0b8aa8 100%); padding: 32px; text-align: center; }
    .header.late { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b42318 0%, #e5484d 100%); }
    .header h1 { color: #ffffff; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; }
    .header p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); font-size: 14px; margin-top: 6px; }
    .body { padding: 32px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 16px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .desc { font-size: 14px; color: #5a7682; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .card { background: #f3f8fa; border: 1px solid #dbe9ee; border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .card .who { font-size: 13px; color: #5a7682; }
    .card .amount { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; color: #0e2a33; margin: 4px 0; }
    .card .when { font-size: 13px; color: #5a7682; }
    .hint { font-size: 12px; color: #9ab0b9; line-height: 1.6; }
    .footer { background: #f9fafb; padding: 20px 32px; text-align: center; }
    .footer p { font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.6; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header {{#if late}}late{{/if}}">
      <h1>{{headline}}</h1>
      <p>Rabbit Tracker reminder</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p class="greeting">Hi {{firstName}},</p>
      <p class="desc">{{body}}</p>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="who">{{#if whoLine}}{{whoLine}}{{else}}{{#if isDebt}}You pay{{else}}Owed by{{/if}} {{person}}{{/if}}</div>
        <div class="amount">{{amount}}</div>
        <div class="when">{{#if late}}Was due{{else}}Due{{/if}} {{dueText}}</div>
      </div>
      <p class="hint">Open the app to record the payment, move the pay date, or snooze this reminder. You can change reminder emails in Settings &rarr; Notifications.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer"><p>You are receiving this because reminders are switched on for this record.</p></div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
